 so I can’t see your actual display name.\n\nTo check what Teams shows as your name:\n- In Teams, click your profile picture (top-right). The name shown there is your display name.\n\nTo change it:\n- Personal account: go to account.microsoft.com/profile, sign in, and choose Edit name to update it. This updates Teams.\n- Work or school account: display name is managed in your organization’s directory (Azure AD). You or your IT admin can update it in the Azure portal:\n  - Azure Active Directory > Users > [Your user] > Profile/Display name.\n  - Changes may take some time to propagate.\n\nIf you tell me whether your account is personal or work/school, I can give you exact steps for your case.","additional_properties":{"logprobs":[]}}],"author_name":"Teams Agent","additional_properties":{}}
